## What this repository does not contain

- No Assetto Corsa game files, car models (.kn5), car textures or modder template packs, and no brand logos or livery artwork. Those belong to their owners and are
  never committed (see .gitignore). The repository holds only code, documentation, and measurements about a car's texture layout (panel names, rectangles).
- No reference photographs.

